{
  // Planned roles only. Luna does not read or apply these defaults yet.
  // PDF viewer: Document Viewer (evince).
  // Image viewer: imv for every image MIME type it supports.
  // Video player: mpv for every video MIME type it supports.
  // File manager and directory handler: Files (nautilus).
  // File picker: Nautilus-backed chooser; TODO configure and verify Hyprland portal routing.
  // File previews: Sushi in Nautilus, opened with Space.
  // Disk management: GNOME Disks (gnome-disk-utility).
  // Screen color picker: hyprpicker.
  // Terminal: Kitty (kitty).
  // Terminal sessions and panes: tmux; configuration and shortcuts come later.
  // Manual pages: man-db. Concise command examples: tldr.
  // JSON processing: jq. Media conversion: ffmpeg. QR generation: qrencode.
  // Firewall: ufw; TODO define rules and service setup before enabling it.
  // Bluetooth controls: bluetoothctl (bluez-utils), backed by bluez; service setup is TODO.
  // Backlight controls: brightnessctl; hardware detection and bindings are TODO.
  // Audio controls: wpctl (wireplumber) is a candidate; confirm session integration before making it default.
  // Wayland clipboard commands: wl-copy and wl-paste (wl-clipboard).
  // GitHub workflows: gh (github-cli), already declared in packages.jsonc.
  // Coding agent: Codex, already owned by apps/codex/app.jsonc.
  // Cloudflare workflows: cf, installed through the cloudflare-cf mise recipe.
  // Native messaging apps: Discord and Telegram; no protocol defaults selected yet.
  // Recording and streaming app: OBS Studio; no capture shortcuts selected yet.
